sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Biller
  participant P as Predictor
  participant L as Claim ledger
  participant R as Rule table
  participant E as EVV + auths
  participant M as LLM (Haiku)

  B->>P: Run pre-check on batch
  P->>P: Clean + normalise fields
  P->>R: Rules for this payer, valid on the date of service
  P->>E: Verified visits + matching authorization
  P->>L: Units left on auth, earlier claims same visit / same day
  P->>P: Rule engine: D01 to D09 checks
  P->>M: Claim + computed facts + payer rules
  M-->>P: Fuzzy-rule verdict (D04 / D10), plain-English reason, cited rule
  P->>P: Combine results, pick the code the payer would report
  P->>P: Classify fix: data / process / not fixable
  P-->>B: Pass / at risk + code + reason + suggested fix
